WEBVTT

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.300
- Danke schön!
- Bitte.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:11.110
Umm, sis, what is this?

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:17.580
You didn't do any of the laundry! It's your turn to do the laundry this week!

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:20.380
Sorry, but I was busy with my shoot.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.600
- I don't have anything to wear today. 
- You're so annoying.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.340
You're a complete mess.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:40.040
Jun, don't talk to your sister like that.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:43.350
If you need clothes, there are some hanging on the balcony.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.340
Kaya, you did the laundry for me?

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:50.830
I'm basically freeloading, so that's the least I can do.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.870
Everything would be nicer if Kaya would just marry into our family and live here.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:01.410
Ugh, sis.

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:41.690
I guess everyone is off today.

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:45.890
They all decided to take the day off on the same day...

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:49.360
- ...and I was worried, but no one will come in this weather.
- Give me salt...

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:58.670
Wow, it's really starting to pour now. I'm going to take a break. Take care of the place, will ya?

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:03.950
- Wait, what if a customer comes?
- Just do whatever.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.040
Give me salt...

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:15.440
Baby Blue Rain

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:24.170
- Are you OK?
- Yes.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:28.930
Why don't you just stay like that the whole day. You're not leaving the house, right?

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.490
This cream puff -- did you make it?

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:37.180
Yes, I made the outside shell with dough, sprinkled it with some sugar...

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:40.200
...and the cream inside is made with vanilla bean...

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.770
...blueberries, banana, and strawberry jam.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:47.210
Sounds so good! May I have one?

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:52.400
I actually have some guests arriving in a little bit, would you like to have some with us?

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:55.170
Guests? Someone is coming to our place?

00:03:55.590 --> 00:04:00.490
- Yes, Arashi is coming to visit. 
- Oh, Arashi is?

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:04.160
It's only Arashi that is coming, right?

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.390
Yasaka isn't going to be joining her, is he?

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:16.930
- I doubt it. 
- I hope you're right.

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.310
- Yeah, I doubt it. 
- I doubt it too.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:27.860
Yes, this is the Kamigamo residence... Oh, yes.. .OK...

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:32.830
- We will be waiting for your arrival. 
- Who was that? 
- I wonder if it was Arashi.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:38.400
- Jun's boyfriend. 
- You gotta be kidding... Yasaka?

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:43.240
He is dodging the rain nearby. He will be headed over as soon as the rain dies down.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:48.940
- What the...what do I do now?
- Jun, at least get some clothes on.

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:52.380
What? But...I don't have anything to wear!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:58.120
- Aww... you don't need to get flustered just because your boyfriend is coming over. 
- He's not my boyfriend!

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:05.320
- Jun, some clothes.
- Oh yeah, I forgot! What do I do?

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:09.300
I have some clothes that I got from the stylist. You should just wear that.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:13.340
- It should fit you too. 
- Where are they?

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.850
- In the box inside my room. 
- Thank you!

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:25.640
Oh, no. If he comes, he's going to find out! I better send him back before he comes!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:30.800
- Jun, the rain looks like it's dying down.
- What? Oh no!

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:39.940
- Jun...
- What? 
- Are you leaving the house like that?

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.800
A wedding dress?

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:53.350
- You didn't realize when you were putting it on?
- I was in such a hurry.

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:57.140
Oh no. He's going to come! My clothes and pictures...

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:01.540
- Make sure you hide anything that would reveal that I'm a girl! 
- OK!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:10.400
- We were luckily able to keep from getting drenched. 
- Of course!

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:15.620
- Wait for me, Kamigamo!
- You look so happy, Hajime.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:20.050
Of course, it's the first time I got invited over to the house!

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:24.630
What shall I do?

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:31.100
- What do you mean?
- Nothing.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:35.270
Oh, remember your manners when you go over to Jun's house.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:46.770
- I can't believe it. Jun still hasn't told them she's a girl?
- Yes.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:56.040
This is Jun's parents' picture, right?
How come it's placed underneath the other pictures?

00:06:56.390 --> 00:07:01.110
Jun kept this picture away from her sight because she used to cry when she saw it as a child.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:06.680
- She would cry? 
- She said it's frightening...the wedding dress, I mean.

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:15.180
Oh my gosh.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:21.330
What am I doing? I don't have time to be playing around!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.960
I must keep this hidden until the end.

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:33.790
Kaya, how is the progress on your side going?

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:40.290
- What an elegant Kimono.
- Right?

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:45.000
Our parents spoiled Jun so much.

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:49.940
Hey, you two! I thought I told you guys to clean! What are you doing looking at old pictures?

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:52.460
I forgot.

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:58.830
- Kaya, can you please hurry up? Yasaka will be arriving anytime now.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:10.610
Okay...I see...come safely.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:15.960
They're right around the corner, but he said he can't come over until the rain completely dies down.

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:20.230
Alright, I still have time. Kaya can you please help me hide these?

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:23.260
- Somewhere he would never find out. 
- Leave it to me.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:27.590
Oh no. What did we do to deserve this?

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.220
This...?

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.000
Can you not mess up my room?

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:59.320
Sis, don't take it over there! I have to hide it, or he's going to find out!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.080
What's the matter?

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:11.200
- Jun, what are you doing?
- Umm...Kaya, what are you doing?

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:17.060
While I was hiding your drawer in the bathroom, I noticed the soap scum on the bathtub...

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:21.360
...so I began cleaning it, and when I turned on the faucet...

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:24.510
...the shower completely soaked me.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:28.300
Thanks... that's enough.

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:33.270
Oh no, the rain stopped!

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:37.420
- Hold on. I'll be there in a second. 
- Hey sis!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.330
What about the family picture that's at the entrance?

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.190
The one from my ballet recital.

00:09:46.780 --> 00:09:48.500
I don't think we put that one away.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.880
Kamigamo...you...

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:18.670
- Did cross-dressing become a habit of yours?
- No...no!

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:22.390
- Aww, how cute!
- No...no...no.

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:26.250
A wedding dress? Are you serious? By the way...

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:28.830
...how long are you planning to stay like this?

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.100
Kanako, I received an order.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:53.070
OK, well let's begin preparing it. Yayoi. What is the dish?

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:57.750
It's a...umm... I forgot the name of the dish.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:02.530
- Please describe to me what the meal is like. 
- Alright.

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:08.610
It is a very aromatic, flavorful rice cake...

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:12.980
A beast elaborately dressed in a soft fabric...

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.560
...keeping in heat and everything else.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:18.360
What a passionate dish!

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:23.170
- Do you know of such a dish?
- Of course, I know.

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:37.030
I'm sorry. That's the only outfit we have right now.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:42.410
I also have to apologize for borrowing it.

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:50.370
Arashi, why did you invite Hajime over too? What if he finds out Jun is a girl?

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:54.200
I thought it was a bad idea, but...

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:58.370
...if he finds out, then he finds out. I thought that would be fine too.

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:03.560
- The things you do.  
- Hey, Kamigamo! Hey!

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:09.360
- What do you want?
- Come look at Arashi in the wedding dress. Isn't it pretty?

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:13.470
You didn't even look at it!

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:19.110
Stop it!

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:25.350
- I hate wedding dresses!
- Huh? You're wearing one right now.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:28.890
- I just made a simple mistake.
- Jun.

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:35.290
What flavor cream puff would you like? Blueberry, banana, or strawberry.

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:38.120
- Whatever. 
- I want banana!

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:44.720
- I just realized that I haven't gargled or washed my hands yet. 
- What? You never do that.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:50.420
- I become a better person when I'm out at a guest's house. 
- Right on, Hajime!

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.400
Excuse me, but I'm going to use your restroom.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:58.380
Oh no. The restroom has the...

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:04.210
- Hey Hajime! Look outside, there's a skyfish flying!
- What? Really?

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:08.420
Where is the skyfish?

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:12.110
Oh no, that...

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:17.460
I don't see anything.

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:18.990
Kaya.

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:24.470
Hey, can I get a refill on the water?

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:27.370
The service here...

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:31.230
The water should be in the fridge, right?

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.760
The cream puff is so good!

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:44.130
- Kaya, you're already done?
- Then, this one's mine!

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:52.660
I was saving it for later.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:56.450
I should have said something.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:14:01.230
- Can I get some more tea?
- Oh, it's in the fridge.

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:04.160
In the refrigerator?

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:10.210
- I'll get it for you. 
- Oh no. Don't worry about it.

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:12.950
I don't want you to get up.

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:21.300
Pantyhose?

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:25.920
Underwear?

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:29.140
- What is this?
- It's mine.

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:36.050
I didn't do anything!

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:38.820
Why is there pantyhose in the fridge?

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:42.010
I heard that it's harder to get a run in them if you keep them cool.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:45.860
Wise words a grandmother would say..

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.750
The fridge is a sacred place for young girls.

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:59.940
But I'll tell you the rest of that story when you're a little older.

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:07.460
I'm so full.

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:11.280
Yasaka, if you're done eating... Hurry up and go home!

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:15.990
- What do you mean? I'm waiting for the main dish! 
- The main dish?

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:24.720
- Of course! Scavenger hunt!
- Wait a second. Yasaka!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:33.320
Hajime Yasaka - Yasagashi Hajimeta (Scavenger Hunt / Began)

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:40.430
Hajime! Stop it. What if you find something you're not supposed to.

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:42.560
What a fun kid.

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:46.250
I haven't seen Jun act like that in a while.

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:50.650
They're like that all the time at Hako-bune.

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:54.060
Hmm, I see. I get it.

00:15:55.870 --> 00:16:00.970
- By the way Kaya, why are you holding on to that banana cream puff?
- No reason.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:06.260
I know! I bet you're thinking if you leave it, that I'll take it!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:10.780
I'm sorry about earlier. Don't worry. I won't take it.

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:14.380
I won't eat it. I won't eat it.

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:21.010
Finders keepers!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.830
What the...there's nothing here.

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:34.000
Or...it's actually hidden HERE!

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:36.870
Hey!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:42.320
- There's nothing here either.
- You...

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:46.780
What are you planning to find on this scavenger hunt? Wait...

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:50.700
...has he figured out that I'm actually a girl? Is he trying to find proof?

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:55.030
It's there!

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:05.000
- I wonder if something happened. 
- Arashi.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:13.150
- I'll be right back. 
- Why don't you leave your cream puff here. I promise I won't eat it.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:18.220
I know. It was my fault for not keeping my eye on it earlier.

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:28.950
Oh no! My winter school uniform.

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:40.390
- Is that it? Let me see it!
- Stop it, you idiot!

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:44.560
Jun, Hajime. Stop it now!

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:47.050
Kaya!

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:56.030
She disappeared.

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:03.290
Yasaka!

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:09.340
- It's all red.
- My...cream puff...

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:12.590
My last cream puff...

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.200
Who is it? Is someone here?

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:20.840
Oh no! I'm nearby in this time period!

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:27.470
Give me back my cream puff...my cream puff!

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:32.920
Give me back my cream puff!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:36.070
Give it back...

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:40.720
Give it back!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:48.720
A GHOST!

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:53.780
- My cream puff.
- That was close.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:57.480
- Wow, that was quick.
- Where did you guys go?

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:00.280
Oh...just to the bathroom.

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:04.010
Jun are you alright? Are you hurt?

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.990
No. The strawberry cream puff got on me.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:13.150
OK. I'm glad.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:20.280
- You're not mad?
- No. Someone gave it to me. Do you want any coffee?

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:29.460
- What?
- I just remembered...

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:33.850
...when you were little. You were crying because you saw a bloody bride.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:38.730
You told me while you were crying that it had disappeared into thin air.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:42.900
You hated wedding dresses from that day on.

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.350
That was...

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:49.110
- Yasaka!
- Hey Kamigamo...

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:51.980
Your house is big and nice.

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:57.230
No matter how loud and rowdy we are, it's OK.

00:19:57.390 --> 00:20:00.830
And there's always warm tea ready for you.

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:03.220
It's such a nice home.

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:08.920
- You need to become a better man.
- Shut up!

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:12.430
And I heard from your sister...

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.900
...that everything got thrown away...that thing.

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:20.140
I was trying so hard to try to find earlier.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:26.220
- What thing?
- You know. That thing. Don't be shy.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:30.710
- How cute. 
- What are you talking about? Tell me.

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:41.030
I can't say it in front of the ladies.

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:49.120
WHY WOULD I HAVE SOMETHING LIKE THAT?!

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.210
Thank you for waiting.

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:58.170
This is a ham sandwich, right?

00:22:31.980 --> 00:22:36.350
- Yayoi, how are you doing?
- I'm doing very well, Kanako.

00:22:36.470 --> 00:22:42.050
- I'm glad. 
- I saw another funny action shot.

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:46.830
- What is the name of that action shot. 
- That's...

00:22:47.430 --> 00:22:51.890
- ...sorry I forgot the name. 
- Please tell me about it.

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:54.410
OK. No problem.

00:22:56.510 --> 00:23:01.320
It's a mysterious story...

00:23:01.320 --> 00:23:07.240
The maidens dramatically changed their appearance from puberty...

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:11.510
...they met someone, found out the meaning of love, and then drowned in their sorrows...

00:23:11.510 --> 00:23:15.720
And when an enemy approached, they would put up their weapons mercilessly.

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:18.490
Wow, what an encouraging story.

00:23:18.550 --> 00:23:23.780
There's a saying that the lovely black beast always mentions to the warrior.

00:23:23.970 --> 00:23:26.100
What is that? Please tell me.

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:29.100
In the name of the moon...

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:35.020
- If I say weather...
- The summer heat wave?

00:23:35.020 --> 00:23:40.340
- The weather forecast isn't reliable. 
- There was never one during my lifetime.

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:42.440
Let's wake up nice and early tomorrow!
